(ii) CW-01 contract was signed on 21 Feb 2025 with Hunan Road and Bridge Construction Group Co., Ltd.;

(iii) CS-03 contract (Road Safety Advisory iRAP) was signed on 23 May 2025 with International Road Assessment Programme; and

(iv) CS-04 contract (Greed Roads Design Advisory) was signed on 16 June 2025 with JV MetaMeta Research B.V. and Muhandisoni Rohnamo LLC. 
